ture":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T17:03:46-08:00","id":361747,"title":"","content":"So... do we all know each other already or is fate bringing us together in this one spot?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T17:22:25-08:00","id":361764,"title":"","content":"Already posted this on the wrong thread... <br /> Check your PMs, Loki. My charsheet is waiting, if you hadn't seen it already; I'm not sure if posting it on the thread was sufficient.<br /> <br /> <br /> As for knowing each other, I'm fine with whatever; it's plausible that my Elder could have introduced me to any of you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T17:45:13-08:00","id":361795,"title":"","content":"The first idea that popped into my head is that we all end up at a Tavern/Market and end up talking about the current guild situation.<br /> <br /> Do I have a Yu Shan / Gold Faction mission in town? Luxweaver's character is probably the best one for giving our group direction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T17:46:03-08:00","id":361798,"title":"","content":"Okay, in the interest of cutting down on lengthy get-to-know-you scenes, anyone want to start out linked? I'm looking for someone who wants a loyal apprentice/henchman/student, a skilled mortal who they are not yet aware is a Sidereal trying to manipulate them into greatness and service to Creation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T17:50:39-08:00","id":361802,"title":"","content":"I am waiting on Loki's okay to move my character's progression forward a bit and have Flynn already have the awkward conversation to join the Gold Faction. There is probably going to be a list of &quot;Things Flynn is suppose to do to keep the support of the Gold Faction. Yes, that means you can't drink, Flynn&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T18:01:38-08:00","id":361809,"title":"","content":"As a Gold Faction Sid, I'd be happy to start out in a bar having that awkward conversation with you. It'd help a bit if I was able to say, &quot;I've been working with Solar X, and the Gold Faction's goal in the area is X,&quot; though. I'd also like a list of things the Gold Faction wants in the area, so's I can work toward them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T18:03:15-08:00","id":361814,"title":"","content":"I just got permission from Loki to be an official gold faction member. We can still have an awkward conversation in the bar. Actually that would be a good place to start.<br /> <br /> I'll start writing something up. I can edit it if you have already started something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T18:13:44-08:00","id":361826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=361809#post361809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As a Gold Faction Sid, I'd be happy to start out in a bar having that awkward conversation with you. It'd help a bit if I was able to say, &quot;I've been working with Solar X, and the Gold Faction's goal in the area is X,&quot; though. I'd also like a list of things the Gold Faction wants in the area, so's I can work toward them.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can feel free to have this conversation in the game. You are all already together on the outskirts. It would be easy to settle down and talk.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=361795#post361795\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The first idea that popped into my head is that we all end up at a Tavern/Market and end up talking about the current guild situation.<br /> <br /> Do I have a Yu Shan / Gold Faction mission in town? Luxweaver's character is probably the best one for giving our group direction.</div> </div> </div> </div>I will give all missions via PMs. It will stay secretive just like it would in creation and heaven. You can share it if you like. That is all up to you. <br /> <br /> <br /> As far as connections are concerned, everyone has met and been travelling together to the city. You all may have had seperate reasons for coming, but fate brought you all together as a small group. You may know your earlier friends are exalted, but you won't know everyone is exalted (unless you can perceive essence of course).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T18:17:05-08:00","id":361830,"title":"","content":"Hey, since we're both here, why wait? We can do it IC, if you like. Meeting up in a little teahouse in the city we've just been assigned to seems like a good way to get things started.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T18:18:54-08:00","id":361835,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=361809#post361809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As a Gold Faction Sid, I'd be happy to start out in a bar having that awkward conversation with you. It'd help a bit if I was able to say, &quot;I've been working with Solar X, and the Gold Faction's goal in the area is X,&quot; though. I'd also like a list of things the Gold Faction wants in the area, so's I can work toward them.</div> </div> </div> </div>How about a Lunar? I'm frankly not sure how to get Nahuel started otherwise, and we've got an easy in, in the form of a Changing Moon elder that I'm indebted to and could be friendly towards the Gold faction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-nam