br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T18:03:54-08:00","id":369234,"title":"","content":"I like the pic, Guru. Wish I could &quot;whip up&quot; drawings half that good.<br /> <br /> My RPnation account has more than zero posts. <br /> <br /> Yeddims are practically Exalted's mascot, heh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T18:07:56-08:00","id":369237,"title":"","content":"The picture is very good. I especially like the shading on the pants.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T19:26:03-08:00","id":369306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=369225#post369225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm just happy Flynn is firmly in the friend's zone. &quot;You are old enough to be my father.&quot; Sweeter words have never been typed. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>So she does not like older men...Good news for me then as i could be her grand-father<br /> <br /> also here here love the pic, and i find the comic interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 01-13-2015, 10:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T19:59:00-08:00","id":369337,"title":"","content":"You know, I am having visions of someone important revealing the hidden mysteries of Creation to us only for us all to yawn and ask if they have anything to say that we don't already know.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah yeah, Sidereals. Secret masters of the world protected by memory obscuring magic who serve as agents and allies of heaven.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Incidentally, when did we all get the <i>talk</i> about this? Splendor doesn't actually know anyone else is an Exalted except the lunar who conveniently used magic right in front of him. He assumes everyone with big weapons is some sort of enlightened mortal or godblooded. He knows about Sidereals but doesn't know anybody else is one in the group.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T20:08:39-08:00","id":369348,"title":"","content":"Flynn has been acting as if everyone thinks he is a mortal musician and acting as if everyone is mortal too. His cover story is that he saw someone he knew get killed by the wild hunt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T21:17:45-08:00","id":369407,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">The Servant is trying to play himself off as an enlightened mortal for as long as he can. he really do not want to be exposed as he truly is less the people who want him find him. as for me know that Owl and Flynn are sidereal that was due to me not fully understanding the memory obscuring magic when i first met them. i originally thought i would just ret-con that bit of information from my mind but my conversion with the ST said that The Servant actually does know that Flynn and Owl are sidereals, because he dos know of there existence (a horribly warped and propagandized view of them at least) from his former master that is now hunting me and they did say the words Maidens a word no-one should be speaking less they know of them. The Servant then made an intuitive leap that they are sidereals. Sidereals that are acting totally counter to what he would expect, but his master has lied to him before abut so so many things. </span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 01-14-2015, 12:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T06:03:39-08:00","id":369707,"title":"","content":"Bah. I made the assumption that the maidens are well known in creation. They aren't really worshiped but the are invoked in major life events. For example, Venus is mention when you name a new born child.<br /> <br /> Anyways, the Servant is a paranoid bastard, so it might be in character for him to think anyone mentioning the word &quot;maiden&quot; is a Sidereal. This time he happens to be right.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-14-2015, 09:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T08:20:41-08:00","id":369756,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=369707#post369707\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bah. I made the assumption that the maidens are well known in creation. They aren't really worshiped but the are invoked in major life events. For example, Venus is mention when you name a new born child.<br /> <br /> Anyways, the Servant is a paranoid bastard, so it might be in character for him to think anyone mentioning the word &quot;maiden&quot; is a Sidereal. This time he happens to be right.</div> </div> </div> </div>They are worshiped in Varang, and the Immaculates let them by saying it is just their local (and flawed, barbarian, ignorant etc) version of the Elemental Dragons. There are five colored stars that move differently than the rest of them which could be grounds for believing in something like them as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T08:35:15-08:00","id":369776,"title":"","content":"Also, it might not be in any Sidereal's best interest to persecute anyone who is worshiping the Maidens. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Page 19 of Glories of the Most High: The Maidens of Destiny has details on their Observance in Creation.<br /> <br /> But, I'm okay with moving on with Luxweaver's character knowing that we are Sidereal. I really just want clarification for any future NPCs we might meet. <br /> <br /> Also, Flynn is designed so that he can be either deep cover or openly Sidereal, depending on the group. I've never played Sidereal before, so I didn't know which way was most feasible in a mixed group. Thus I tried to account for both options.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-14-2015, 11:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T09:31:33-08:00","id":369798,"title":"","content":"I would appreciate if Luxweaver's character kept it to himself. Splendor's hate of Sidereals means the interaction could be... interesting and I would like to play that out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T10:32:39-08:00","id":369846,"title":"","content":"ya he'll keep it to himself The Servent hates to show any of his cards exspecaly to what is still a large group of strangers. He finds it very odd that a sidereal would be helping anyone. Shouldn't they be busy destroying creation like they did in the past as his former master told him? Plus i would hate to ruin anyone's fun with my actions. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","user":"Luxweaver","date":". 01-14-2015, 01:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T18:00:53-08:00","id":370476,"title":"","content":"Hm...we do have resplendent destinies up, which should raise the difficulty of recognizing us as anything but what we're disguised as (in my cases a badass but still very mortal Guildswoman) by three.<br /> <br /> If y'all were gonna realize Swimming Owl was a Sidereal, I'd have liked to see a roll made to pierce my disguise and a chance to use Thought-Swiping Distraction to try and steal the idea out of your brain before you could follow the thought process to its logical conclusions...but what's done is done. If Owl figures out she's been made, she may end up just leaving and coming back with a new disguise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T18:07:55-08:00","id":370485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=370476#post370476\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hm...we do have resplendent destinies up, which should raise the difficulty of recognizing us as anything but what we're disguised as (in my cases a badass but still very mortal Guildswoman) by three.<br /> <br /> If y'all were gonna realize Swimming Owl was a Sidereal, I'd have liked to see a roll made to pierce my disguise and a chance to use Thought-Swiping Distraction to try and steal the idea out of your brain before you could follow the thought process to its logical conclusions...but what's done is done. If Owl figures out she's been made, she may end up just leaving and coming back with a new disguise.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Because of how things started out, I am not going to force any penalty paradox or anything. This just happens when you have new and veteran players. Don't worry about it too much. Also, when you switch forms, they won't know who you are. I am going to say that they can recognize you because you all traveled together during the journey to Puyo (which is what I mentioned in my first post XD)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T18:09:15-08:00","id":370487,"title":"","content":"i totally agree with you and have since read up of sidereals much more, and thanks for being so kind. this is my first exalted game and i'm still new to multiplayer role-play as a whole. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T18:13:22-08:00","id":370491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luxweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=370487#post370487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i totally agree with you and have since read up of sidereals much more, and thanks for being so kind. this is my first exalted game and i'm still new to multiplayer role-play as a whole. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>In one of my first Exalted games I had a solar with no past life memories from the middle of nowhere who had only ever seen a brush that didn't run out of ink for magic busting out commands to jadeborn to make him artifacts and throwing out so many meta reference to heaven that he couldn't know that the (much better RPed) sid thought I was also a sid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T18:31:56-08:00","id":370515,"title":"","content":"I would prefer not to have Flynn create a new disguise. Mostly because I like writing for both the cheerful and friendly traveling musician and the jaded and ironically joyless Joybringer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T18:52:21-08:00","id":370567,"title":"","content":"You don't need to create a new one, but you can always shuck your destiny to not be noticed by them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T19:06:57-08:00","id":370603,"title":"","content":"so i know Flynn is a sidereal but i don't know its Flynn if i see him when not in his resplendent destiny?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T19:18:06-08:00","id":370612,"title":"","content":"It's kind of complicated. From what I understand, you recognize Flynn's Resplendent Destiny when you see him, but you won't remember any specific details or features about him. If you try to describe Flynn as you know him, you'll be able to remember that he is a musician. Maybe that he carried some sort of instrument. <br /> <br /> You'd remember even less if you met Flynn as a Sidereal. You'll know that there was some man present. And he talked to you. Maybe.<br /> <br /> So if you meet Flynn as the traveling musician and then later on meet Flynn as himself, you'll see them as two different people. If Flynn the Sidereal makes references to something that happens to you and Flynn the Musician, then he gets a point of paradox. <br /> <br /> Arcane Fate sucks for Sidereals too. It's very difficult to make relationships with non-sidereals. Resplendent Destinies have a expiration date. So if over the course of time The Servant and Flynn become good friends, as soon as Flynn's Resplendent Destiny ends, you won't remember Flynn the Musician. Flynn would have to restart the friendship from scratch and risk gaining paradox. <br /> <br /> Anyone else feel free to correct me if I got any of the above wrong. As I said, it's kind of complicated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T19:28:54-08:00","id":370618,"title":"","content":"Also, out of character, I am waiting for some of the other players who haven't had a chance to do something post. I work at a computer all day, so I probably post more than everyone else. Time to let other people do stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T19:37:58-08:00","id":370628,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=370612#post370612\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's kind of complicated. From what I understand, you recognize Flynn's Resplendent Destiny when you see him, but you won't remember any specific details or features about him. If you try to describe Flynn as you know him, you'll be able to remember that he is a musician. Maybe that he carried some sort of instrument.<br /> <br /> You'd remember even less if you met Flynn as a Sidereal. You'll know that there was some man present. And he talked to you. Maybe.<br /> <br /> So if you meet Flynn as the traveling musician and then later on meet Flynn as himself, you'll see them as two different people. If Flynn the Sidereal makes references to something that happens to you and Flynn the Musician, then he gets a point of paradox.<br /> <br /> Arcane Fate sucks for Sidereals too. It's very difficult to make relationships with non-sidereals. Resplendent Destinies have a expiration date. So if over the course of time The Servant and Flynn become good friends, as soon as Flynn's Resplendent Destiny ends, you won't remember Flynn the Musician. Flynn would have to restart the friendship from scratch and risk gaining paradox.<br /> <br /> Anyone else feel free to correct me if I got any of the above wrong. As I said, it's kind of complicated.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That is correct. Also, as you have continued contact with a person, they can start to remember you even when you aren't there clearly. More details come as you see him more. There is a difference in seeing his destiny and his &quot;true form&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T19:50:23-08:00","id":370636,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Loki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=370628#post370628\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> That is correct. Also, as you have continued contact with a person, they can start to remember you even when you aren't there clearly. More details come as you see him more. There is a difference in seeing his destiny and his &quot;true form&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Yes. Flynn has three background points in acquaintances. He spent years building relationships with a group of mortals. Even then, they don't remember him when he is not around.<br /> <br /> Flynn actually hates arcane destiny. He would give up any advantages it gives in a heart beat .","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 01-14-2015, 11:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-14T20:22:23-08:00","id":370670,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\">A small third circle demon materializes on Flynn's shoulder. Leaning back on Flynn's ear and twirling his forked tail say \u201c Maybe we can make a deal then!\u201d His grin widening </span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"us