d-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T07:05:24-08:00","id":372496,"title":"","content":"Damn. That is a great dice roller. I am going to use that one for now on.<br /> <br /> Here are my RD rolls: <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=VEM29JBF\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=VEM29JBF</a><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T15:57:03-08:00","id":372974,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=371919#post371919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I sorta feel like she's not the Lunar's type.<br /> <br /> She's putting on airs on account of the Guild Merchant outfit, but the girl's a Nexus street rat, born and raised. Woods? Air not polluted by smoke? <i>Wild animals</i> just running around? Being able to see the night sky? <i>Peace and quiet? </i><br /> <br /> These are not things she's fond of.</div> </div> </div> </div>That too... but, no the other hand, Nahuel's pragmatic, and I doubt he'd turn down a quick fling if the opportunity presented itself. If it doesn't, well, no harm done.<br /> <br /> And yeah, he would find your attitude towards wilderness absolutely mystifying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T16:17:37-08:00","id":373019,"title":"","content":"Lucky Swimming Owl is not The Servants type, Nahuel on the other hand... The Servant has pick up a few tricks in his eighty five years.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T16:37:18-08:00","id":373060,"title":"","content":"Flynn prefers women, though he has experience with men though the course of his Yu Shan missions. Flings aren't really Flynn's thing anymore; too much like work (seriously like work, he is one of Heaven's Courtesans). <br /> <br /> Though, I do see Flynn using women and sometimes men as a Sexless Innkeeper. (<a href=\"http://how-i-met-your-mother.wikia.com/wiki/The_Sexless_Innkeeper_%28poem%29\" target=\"_blank\">http://how-i-met-your-mother.wikia.c...per_%28poem%29</a>)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T16:40:30-08:00","id":373065,"title":"","content":"I love that &quot;Avoiding the Truth Technique&quot; was changed in the errata. It is so much better now. That was a great use of it though!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-17T09:17:08-08:00","id":373522,"title":"","content":"Sorry, old drunk man with a knife in your boot. <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=K4W9V69B\" target=\"_blank\">I botched my Compassion roll. </a><br /> <br /> We hardly knew ye.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","e