\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T10:36:43-08:00","id":402058,"title":"","content":"Would it be possible to get a general description of the manse, such as what it looks like, the general layout, and the way it is furnished?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T10:55:46-08:00","id":402091,"title":"","content":"A description would be nice to have. I was just assuming the dining room would have chairs to sit in. I don't know what Flynn is sitting on otherwise. lol","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T06:21:51-08:00","id":403239,"title":"","content":"I am going to be away from internet contact until Sunday. I don't think this will have too much of an impact on the game. <br /> <br /> I have something written up for the IC thread, but Flynn is waiting on the others to speak before he says his piece.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T01:41:23-08:00","id":404278,"title":"","content":"Put up a description of the dining room.<br /> <br /> If you can't tell yet, Talos has only been Exalted for about a month now. The whole &quot;being endowed with unlimited power&quot; thing is still a bit new to him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-14T12:53:15-08:00","id":406045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=406036#post406036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u201cI was traveling in the Realm Satrap as a child, I don\u2019t remember which one, and someone once showed me an old, old, old machine. The farmer said that it had the power to strip seeds from cotton. No one knew how it worked or what powered it. \u201c</div> </div> </div> </div>Ironically, the Cotton Gin increased the need for slaves as it increased the amount of cotton produced and indirectly lead to the Civil War. Not that any of this history happened in Exalted. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T04:56:24-08:00","id":406593,"title":"","content":"Sorry, Exthalion, I didn't realize that your character was trying to hide they were a Solar. Opps.<br /> <br /> To be honest, out of character, I am getting impatient with the &quot;Who are you? What do you want?&quot; segment. I want to do stuff! Have the dice roller royally screw me over! That might be my inexperience with Play by Post games. Might just have to learn to be patient.<br /> <br /> That doesn't mean I want stuff to happen right now. We have already been interrupted once during the &quot;get to know you phase&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-15-2015, 08:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T09:59:00-08:00","id":406799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=406593#post406593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry, Exthalion, I didn't realize that your character was trying to hide they were a Solar. Opps.<br /> <br /> To be honest, out of character, I am getting impatient with the &quot;Who are you? What do you want?&quot; segment. I want to do stuff! Have the dice roller royally screw me over! That might be my inexperience with Play by Post games. Might just have to learn to be patient.<br /> <br /> That doesn't mean I want stuff to happen right now. We have already been interrupted once during the &quot;get to know you phase&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not a problem at all, and I agree we can move past the introductions. I have to get to work rebuilding that bar. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T10:04:41-08:00","id":406800,"title":"","content":"I tried to sneak in the tree piece to get things going. I know we still have introductions to do, but I can skip to the next portion if need be. I just didn't want to take over the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T10:09:33-08:00","id":406804,"title":"","content":"Well, I think we need a party goal. So far the only thing I have heard is &quot;Get rid of Guild Slave Trade&quot;. Which is a fine goal, if everyone agrees on it. <br /> <br /> I liked the falling tree part. It just was poorly timed. Flynn totally missed all of Splendor's Speech on what he wanted to do. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T10:10:22-08:00","id":406808,"title":"","content":"I think that if someone leaves the manse... I can make a stronger bond <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T10:18:05-08:00","id":406813,"title":"","content":"Let's finish the conversation first (and come up with a party goal) and then Flynn or someone can go outside for some fresh air.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T14:06:01-08:00","id":406962,"title":"","content":"Party goal ideas:<br /> <br /> 1. Rebuild the tavern. Conquer the region through creating a perfected restaurant, whose cuisine overpowers armies!<br /> 2. Seize direct power-walk into the local goverment's offices and declare ourselves the new rulers of the place! Brutally suppress opposition!<br /> 3. Poison the local water supply, then act as healers who cure the resulting plague! Reap public goodwill and ride the tide of popularity into positions of power!<br /> 4. Just start summoning demons like crazy. I never met a problem you couldn't solve by throwing the right demons (and the right numbers of demons) at it!<br /> 5. Start a circus!<br /> 6. Free the ninety percent of the Guild's slaves by just straight-up buying them all! We can get the financing by selling the remaining ten percent of them to Demon Lords that we sorcerously bind to give us a ridiculously good deal!<br /> 7. Just nuke the place and rebuild from the ground up. Seems easier than trying to co-opt existing infrastructure.<br /> 8. Our Lunar eats all the major power players and pretends to be them. We run things secretly from behind the scenes. When enemy armies attack, we do the same thing to their generals.<br /> 9. Start summoning elementals and binding them to possess local mortals, thus giving all of our mortal population elemental superpowers. Claim to be the Immaculate Dragons reborn to save the world from evil, and that these new Dragonblooded are your chosen servants!<br /> 10. Hijack the moon, and crash it into Thorns!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T14:13:38-08:00","id":406966,"title":"","content":"I say we roll a d10 and see what we get as a party goal! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T14:18:44-08:00","id":406968,"title":"","content":"Actually, buying the property the Sailor's Grotto was located on and rebuilding it as a base of political shenanigans is a pretty good idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T15:54:05-08:00","id":407093,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the delay in posting. Nahuel's trying to listen more than he talks at this point, and I needed to get some thoughts in order.<br /> <br /> It's... more challenging than I expected, playing an ignorant character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T16:36:57-08:00","id":407132,"title":"","content":"My character has been either drunk or hung over for the past two weeks. I might have bitten off more than I can chew with Flynn. Kind of regret taking that vice flaw now as an undercover Sidereal. Sometimes I think I have Drunk Flynn be more coherent than he should be. <br /> <br /> Oh well. I'll make it work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T17:12:42-08:00","id":407146,"title":"","content":"You oughta take the charm that lets you just pass on the effects of a poison by touch. Drink as much as you want, and then if you need to think clearly just slap somebody else drunk and be instantly sober!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T17:23:46-08:00","id":407152,"title":"","content":"That was the original idea back when Flynn was a Martial Artist Instructor. But I decided I could be a crappy MA Chosen of Serenity or a Awesome Performance Chosen of Serenity. I chose the second option. Though eventually, I'd like to take Flynn more towards the MA Instructor type. Throne Shadow Style is right up his alley.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-16T12:00:34-08:00","id":408009,"title":"","content":"Awesome. Things look they are starting to move. We even have 10 ideas to move forward (and maybe more unsaid). <br /> <br /> Also, I was wondering if you would all be okay with something, I started to create my own exalted race called the Soranic (the Exalted of the empty space in the sky). They are the masters of elsewhere (nearly every charm involves the use of elsewhere) and are extremely intelligent. I haven't completely finished them (I only have about 35 charms... missing several abilities), but I was wondering if you wouldn't mind if I included one in the game. I don't want to go too much into their lore and give anything away, but they did choose to not be remembered and left creation. You'll get more details farther in if we do have one. <br /> <br /> I don't mind if you all don't want it. Just let me know what you all think. (It wouldn't become a major plot point, unless you wanted it to be; I just want to test one out.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-16T13:10:16-08:00","id":408108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Loki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=408009#post408009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Awesome. Things look they are starting to move. We even have 10 ideas to move forward (and maybe more unsaid).<br /> <br /> Also, I was wondering if you would all be okay with something, I started to create my own exalted race called the Soranic (the Exalted of the empty space in the sky). They are the masters of elsewhere (nearly every charm involves the use of elsewhere) and are extremely intelligent. I haven't completely finished them (I only have about 35 charms... missing several abilities), but I was wondering if you wouldn't mind if I included one in the game. I don't want to go too much into their lore and give anything away, but they did choose to not be remembered and left creation. You'll get more details farther in if we do have one.<br /> <br /> I don't mind if you all don't want it. Just let me know what you all think. (It wouldn't become a major plot point, unless you wanted it to be; I just want to test one out.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds sort of like Nocturnals...<br /> <br /> Regardless, I have no feeling one way or the other. Do as you will with including them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-16T13:14:33-08:00","id":408114,"title":"","content":"That's fine. Throwing in surprises is part of the game, after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-16T14:33:28-08:00","id":408198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=408108#post408108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sounds sort of like Nocturnals...<br /> <br /> Regardless, I have no feeling one way or the other. Do as you will with including them.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hmm.. not quite like nocturnals. They are not there to &quot;not be seen&quot;. They just decided to leave creation behind and went into elsewhere.. bringing all memories of them along. They are not really the stealthy type. They are just extremely intelligent and good at covering their tracks. They don't have hidden animas or anything. They are more sages than anything. They do have simliar phasing abilities though through some abilities.<br /> <br /> I still haven't created all the animas yet... there are actually 8 castes instead of 5. The mechanics are a bit weird.... but intelligence is always favored (must start with at least 3 int) as well as larceny. They even get the <b>Prodigy- Larceny </b>merit for free. Each caste has 3 favored abilities instead of 5. They even have their own spell level (higher than celestial, but lower than Solar; it has very limited uses, but is powerful). Also, they have their own excellency that is quite powerful. <br /> <br /> <b>Brilliant (Ability) Perfection; 3m/die; instant; reflexive; 5 ability; 4 essence<br /> <br /> Pre-reqs: (Ability) Essence Flow</b><br /> <br /> The Soranic know how to recover from even the most disastrous mistakes instantly with their great intellect. This charm allows the Soran to change up to (intelligence/2) (rounded down) failures in a roll to successes automatically. These do not count as dice added to a roll. This charm cannot create an extra success from a die that is already a success. This ability can change a botch <br /> into a success.<br /> <br /> For example, if the Exalt's Intelligence is 6 and they roll (Char(3) + Pres(4)) and roll 1,2,7,7,8,9,10 (6 successes); they can only change the 1 and 2 to successes by spending 4 motes (making 8 successes) even though they could potentially have changed 3 dice (if there were at least that many failures).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-16T14:34:20-08:00","id":408199,"title":"","content":"I'm indifferent to the idea. Do what you will.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-16T22:21:55-08:00","id":408618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Loki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=408009#post408009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Awesome. Things look they are starting to move. We even have 10 ideas to move forward (and maybe more unsaid).<br /> <br /> Also, I was wondering if you would all be okay with something, I started to create my own exalted race called the Soranic (the Exalted of the empty space in the sky). They are the masters of elsewhere (nearly every charm involves the use of elsewhere) and are extremely intelligent. I haven't completely finished them (I only have about 35 charms... missing several abilities), but I was wondering if you wouldn't mind if I included one in the game. I don't want to go too much into their lore and give anything away, but they did choose to not be remembered and left creation. You'll get more details farther in if we do have one.<br /> <br /> I don't mind if you all don't want it. Just let me know what you all think. (It wouldn't become a major plot point, unless you wanted it to be; I just want to test one out.)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hey, you gotta test that stuff out somehow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-17T12:43:13-08:00","id":409226,"title":"","content":"I don't mean to shoe horn anyone into the anti-slavery goal. It is the only common goal I see among the PCs right now that will keep us together. We can always change our goal later if some deathknights or Soranics show up or something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-17T13:29:43-08:00","id":409271,"title":"","content":"No worries. I'm more concerned that a combat build like mine isn't the right fit for this game, since it seems like subtle and quiet is the order of the day...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-17T13:41:52-08:00","id":409277,"title":"","content":"We will need someone to be a brawler if things go bad. Also, I think your character brings a great perspective to the game.<br /> <br /> And just because the scheming Gold Faction Sider.... I mean.... poor, helpless, fragile mortals are suggesting subtle and quiet doesn't mean you character has to listen to them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-17-2015, 06:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-17T22:43:50-08:00","id":409704,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=409226#post409226\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't mean to shoe horn anyone into the anti-slavery goal. It is the only common goal I see among the PCs right now that will keep us together. We can always change our goal later if some deathknights or Soranics show up or something.</div> </div> </div> </div>The deathknights will your main problem... they are fighting for influence too after all...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-17T22:44:39-08:00","id":409706,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=409271#post409271\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No worries. I'm more concerned that a combat build like mine isn't the right fit for this game, since it seems like subtle and quiet is the order of the day...</div> </div> </div> </div>There will be times where you are definitely needed. Besides a pack mule is great to have :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T05:03:23-08:00","id":409930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Loki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=409706#post409706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There will be times where you are definitely needed. Besides a pack mule is great to have :P</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking of pack mule, is Flynn the only one carrying a bag? I figured we just got off a caravan, so we have stuff. Maybe playing Pathfinder has been a bad influence on me. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T09:21:49-08:00","id":410170,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=409930#post409930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Speaking of pack mule, is Flynn the only one carrying a bag? I figured we just got off a caravan, so we have stuff. Maybe playing Pathfinder has been a bad influence on me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, Splendor is Resources 0. When he met Swimming Owl he had the clothes on his back (which he is still wearing) and his daiklave. Since then he has been living off her dime.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> Loki, if there are any rolls involved do I get some sort of bonus for using speculation to fund a ponzi scheme on the performance of my own speculative assets and propped up by credit default swaps betting against my own scheme?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-18-2015, 05:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T14:51:17-08:00","id":410549,"title":"","content":"Holy crap, Splendor really is from Yu-Shan! The shear amount of corrupt bureaucracy in that plan is amazing. I'm glad I'm not the only one that steals from history/current events for my character's goals and scheming.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T15:56:56-08:00","id":410665,"title":"","content":"Okay. I want to verify I understand this out of character before I ask questions and make comments in character:<br /> <br /> <u><b>The Harvest God Priesthood</b></u><br /> This is where we are going to get the funding for this scheme. We sell membership into the Priesthood which entitles members to the promised massive profits from the Harvest Fields. We will used the membership fees to buy the fields, rent slaves, and to eventually buy the slaves at the end of the season.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Stern Order of Slave Overseers</b></u><br /> This really isn't part of the money making scheme, but part of the Help Slaves goal. This group will sell outsourcing services to the Slave Owners. Actually, since the slaves would be on the Priesthood's fields, the group could sell its services to the Priesthood itself. (or just have the stern order be a part of the priesthood). It will play at being stern but in will actually treat the slaves well. Good Medical Care. Decent Food. Maybe help located sold off family members. Give them fair wages to be paid towards their eventually freedom.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Inventors</b></u><br /> This is how we will sell the promises we made to the Priesthood. It is though use of these devices (and our slave overseeing methods) that we will get the massive yields. It is though failure of these devices (?) that we will cause doubt of the Priesthood's success.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Insurance Sellers</b></u><br /> These people will sell insurance to the Priesthood. The members will get their money back if the Priesthood fails to deliver on their promises. The insurance premiums will be used to pay the interest on the debt we took on to start up the priesthood. <br /> <br /> The profit part is that the devices actually do work? And that the slaves didn't need to do anything at all after a while since the devices do work?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-18-2015, 07:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T16:19:44-08:00","id":410684,"title":"","content":"Fairly close. To use some modern terms:<br /> <br /> <u><b>The Harvest God Priesthood</b></u><br /> This is both where we are funding the scheme and where the money will come at the end. We use the Inventors and some pageantry with the god to drum up interest for our Initial Public Offering of Stock in the venture. (Or, since those don't exist yet, membership). Each membership comes with a percentage, but we are going to oversell such that if they all got together and counted their percentages would come to over 100%. This is not strictly necessary, but we need a lot of money for the whole thing.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Stern Order of Slave Overseers</b></u><br /> They are the Shill for the Priesthood. If all the slaves are worked to death or uselessness, as the Slave Owners think the Stern Order will leave them, then the priesthood will need new slaves for the next harvest. So the Owners will agree to sell them to the priesthood because they don't expect to get any more value out of them and to have a repeat client. The Owners think they are taking advantage of the priesthoods bleeding hearts rather than thinking long term about reusing the slaves.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Inventors</b></u><br /> Another shill for the priesthood, they build confidence in their methods which then translates to the priesthood when we start selling stock. We don't actually have to show the methods will fail to start the panic, we could just spread rumors that the priesthood has more memberships outstanding than its revenue. (Or that it promised all the harvest to the slave owners) They are also going to have the real devices (and probably sorcery) to produce the yields we need to actually pay all these people back.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Insurance Sellers</b></u><br /> These people appear to have nothing to do with the priesthood. They sell insurance to all the members, to be paid if the priesthood fails to deliver its promised monies. Since we don't intend to allow that, the members are paying us money at a steady rate with which to cover our expenses and the payments to members. Essentially, we are paying their promised money with their own money.<br /> <br /> For slight clarification, we are not paying the Slave Owners ALL of the harvest for the slaves, just negotiating something like &quot;Buy 5 slaves per ton of wheat, to be paid at harvest time out of our share of the wheat.&quot;<br /> <br /> We will probably retain a lot of the slaves as actual employees, but we may need to find new income since we are basically paying them with freedom now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-18-2015, 07:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T16:49:43-08:00","id":410745,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the explanation. Flynn has bureaucracy three. I have bureaucracy &quot;I read a book on the housing crisis once&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T18:41:02-08:00","id":410888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=410745#post410745\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for the explanation. Flynn has bureaucracy three. I have bureaucracy &quot;I read a book on the housing crisis once&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Before I forget, the Insurance is not just sold to members, but to anyone who believes that the Harvest Priesthood is going to default. That is part of what makes a credit default swap different from insurance. Its basically a bet that something will fail.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T19:04:30-08:00","id":410920,"title":"","content":"I posted Flynn's response. He simplified your plan a bit.<br /> <br /> And of course, I am going to spend most of the night rereading &quot;The Big Short&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-18-2015, 10:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T21:52:01-08:00","id":411034,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=410170#post410170\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, Splendor is Resources 0. When he met Swimming Owl he had the clothes on his back (which he is still wearing) and his daiklave. Since then he has been living off her dime.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> Loki, if there are any rolls involved do I get some sort of bonus for using speculation to fund a ponzi scheme on the performance of my own speculative assets and propped up by credit default swaps betting against my own scheme?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If you want to check the validity of this situational scheme, roll int+beau with a one die bonus. (good, detailed plan, but not much info on the town)<br /> <br /> Anyone else can roll int+beau without a bonus as well.<br /> <br /> Swimming Owl would get a two die bonus due to knowledge from work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-18T22:10:16-08:00","id":411064,"title":"","content":"Sorry, I was joking about the excessive complexity.<br /> <br /> Spending 1 wp and 1 conviction channel: 6 successes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/4803/view\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.rpnation.com/styles/rpnlogo12.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/4803/view\" target=\"_blank\"> Oops! We ran into some problems. </a> </div> <div 