ankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T19:01:20-08:00","id":412312,"title":"","content":"What time of day is it in game?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T19:02:30-08:00","id":412313,"title":"","content":"It is now late afternoon. They daystar's light will be low right now. Good thing you are inside <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T19:04:57-08:00","id":412314,"title":"","content":"It hasn't been five hours yet, correct? Flynn still has prior warning up.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T19:07:20-08:00","id":412317,"title":"","content":"It has not been 5 hours yet. Prior warning is still up. Nothing seems to be dangerous for you or your companions right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T19:09:16-08:00","id":412320,"title":"","content":"Awesome! Perfect time to go out for a night on the town and start creating the Exalted version of the housing crisis! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Probably should let other people post first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T20:02:18-08:00","id":412361,"title":"","content":"i am excited about the huge number of freed slaves that will love us. Lets just enlighten a few of the most promising of the new followers to our former slave army and take down Mask of Winters","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T21:30:29-08:00","id":412416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=411064#post411064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry, I was joking about the excessive complexity.<br /> <br /> Spending 1 wp and 1 conviction channel: 6 successes.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/4803/view\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpnation.com/dice/4803/view</a></div> </div> </div> </div>And yet, that's the part I most agree with. :P<br /> <br /> I could be convinced to go along with a (simplified?) version of that plan, but it's not my first choice. Agree with Luxweaver about making freed slaves love us, though!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T08:54:11-08:00","id":412853,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=412416#post412416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I could be convinced to go along with a (simplified?) version of that plan, but it's not my first choice.</div> </div> </div> </div>I will fully admit I have out of character concerns about the number of groups we will have to juggle. Four groups that we will have to keep separate? Are we going to have to pretend we don't know each other in most scenes? Is all this juggling going to lead to fun role play situations? I love the credit swap idea, I just rather have less groups to manage. <br /> <br /> Anyways, I'm sure we could talk our way out of any trouble due to excellencies and charms. Luxweaver, Wise Old Guru, and I (maybe WarDragon?) could probably pull it off due to our abilities to take multiple identities. It will increase the risk that you guys break though Arcane Fate and realize that Swimming Owl's investor friend is the same person as Swimming Owl.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T09:47:51-08:00","id":412901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=412853#post412853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I will fully admit I have out of character concerns about the number of groups we will have to juggle. Four groups that we will have to keep separate? Are we going to have to pretend we don't know each other in most scenes? Is all this juggling going to lead to fun role play situations? I love the credit swap idea, I just rather have less groups to manage.<br /> <br /> Anyways, I'm sure we could talk our way out of any trouble due to excellencies and charms. Luxweaver, Wise Old Guru, and I (maybe WarDragon?) could probably pull it off due to our abilities to take multiple identities. It will increase the risk that you guys break though Arcane Fate and realize that Swimming Owl's investor friend is the same person as Swimming Owl.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was going to suggest we hire thieves and conmen off the street to fill out the ranks.<br /> <br /> &quot;I have this great insurance scam. Play the part of salesman and you get a cut. Cheat me and I have my pet anathema strangle you with your own spine.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T11:28:46-08:00","id":412958,"title":"","content":"to me the core of the plan is simply the production of the machines that we are actually going to create. Everything beyond that is just gravy, jade filled gravy. Also i do have a nascent religious order in my back-story that could with just a small amount of work and convincing of the masses become exactly what we need for the scam. even when the temple get sacked by anger debtors if all goes well the philosophy i instill will live on past the temples destruction. the true believes uncorrupted by the greed rampant unknown to them in the temple will rise once more to form a kick ass charity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T12:00:23-08:00","id":412978,"title":"","content":"How long until planting season? How long until harvest? How many months do we have to keep the scam up and running?<br /> <br /> I'm asking because Swimming Owl and Flynn could take out the loans under Resplendent Destinies and shred those Destinies if things go sour. They will tell the rest of the group that their investors wish to be silent or nasty Dragon Bloods or what not. Thus the rest of the group doesn't have/want to meet them to avoid paradox causing situations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-20-2015, 03:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T14:06:06-08:00","id":413102,"title":"","content":"Dude? I've got Salary. Don't even worry about the loans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T14:10:41-08:00","id":413106,"title":"","content":"But but... Fine. We just spend Swimming Owl's money, instead of spending random NPC's. <br /> <br /> Flynn has had his salary knocked down to 2. He's kinda poor in Yu-Shan terms, but not in creation terms (Resources 4, correct?). Probably why he hasn't been back to Yu-Shan in over a year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T15:35:16-08:00","id":413221,"title":"","content":"Resources 0 here, though that will probably change as the game goes on. Nahuel is not the best choice for infiltration and deception... he doesn't have the human form knack, but more pressingly, has Manipulation 1, and a Code of Honor that forbids lying to anyone who's not actively an enemy. At best, he could tag along unobtrusively in the shape of a harmless animal. It's not really a lie, since he is that animal at the time...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T16:32:54-08:00","id":413356,"title":"","content":"Speaking of abilities. Does anyone have war to train the slaves?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T17:26:15-08:00","id":413454,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> tag along unobtrusively in the shape of a harmless animal </div> </div> </div><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> You can be my guy's pet bird siting on his shoulder until he sicks you on someone who stands in the Servant's way. It will be delightful he'll give you crackers and call you Polly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T20:51:58-08:00","id":413656,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=413356#post413356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of abilities. Does anyone have war to train the slaves?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No, but if I can raise my Charisma a dot and buy an Excellency, I could fake it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T21:42:14-08:00","id":413723,"title":"","content":"I could lead as well, but it would be difficult to do that and covertly run a religious organization. I have to do it covertly or the people who want me might try and bring it down to soon. the Servant whould be more then willing to help train Nahuel. He respects the barbarian, he reminds the Servent of when he was younger. But really is you just spend some time around any of us you will get higher charisma. Nahuel is a fast learner it seems.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxw