mage/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T17:11:12-08:00","id":428312,"title":"","content":"Fine with me. I'm sticking around.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T14:27:05-08:00","id":430611,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Loki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361610-clash-of-the-southeast-ic-post-thread?p=428217#post428217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As Flynn and Talos come out of the manse, they hear something. It sounds like it could be screaming from far away. It sounds like it is coming from the direction of the town....<br /> <br /> There are no other signs coming from the town, but the forest life seems to be eerily quiet to everyone...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Loki, to be honest, this is very ambiguous. I'm out right metagaming to find something for my character to do and I'm not sure what to do with this. Town is an hour away and maybe there is something going on there? <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T12:01:37-08:00","id":431603,"title":"","content":"The two character originally planning on leaving the Manse, Flynn and the Servant, were your two big social characters. Something happening doesn't have to involve violence. It could easily be a slaver with slaves on their way to Puyo for the market. Random deathknight on a horse heading towards Puyo to covertly cause trouble. Some bronze faction bastard looking for Splendor and Talos. Any NPC we can talk to and manipulate would work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T14:42:15-08:00","id":431800,"title":"","content":"ah Flynn and The Servant in duo social combat. that will be a sight","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T19:04:00-08:00","id":432118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luxweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=431800#post431800\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ah Flynn and The Servant in duo social combat. that will be a sight</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you suggesting...<br /> <br /> MASS SOCIAL COMBAT!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T21:42:17-08:00","id":432244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=431603#post431603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The two character originally planning on leaving the Manse, Flynn and the Servant, were your two big social characters. Something happening doesn't have to involve violence. It could easily be a slaver with slaves on their way to Puyo for the market. Random deathknight on a horse heading towards Puyo to covertly cause trouble. Some bronze faction bastard looking for Splendor and Talos. Any NPC we can talk to and manipulate would work.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know my post was a bit ambiguous, but from how far away you are in the middle of a forest, not much else can be done. <br /> <br /> As I said, most stuff happening will not directly outline your need to battle, but there WILL be fighting of some sort among the factions of course. What you doesn't have to require violence or fighting. Knowing what is going on and socializing can be important, but if you have no facts of what is happening, socializing will be a bit harder. It is up to you what to do... noone is near the manse, so there is no NPC....<br /> <br /> I don't know what else to give you right now really...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T00:28:42-08:00","id":432396,"title":"","content":"what would Flynn do if he heard distant screaming carried of the wind? In character we where planing to have a nice musical experience then i was hoeping to go eat the heart of some random person for the greater good.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T09:13:03-07:00","id":432627,"title":"","content":"I'm going to stop backseat GMing. I'm just frustrated that all the non-extra NPCs seem to be inaccessible and I have no way for my character to talk to them. Most of the time socializing is how you get information about what is happening. I just don't see any plot hooks to get Flynn to this point, especially if the town is burning. <br /> <br /> I posted something in the IC thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T10:33:55-07:00","id":432724,"title":"","content":"To be fair, screaming doesn't necessarily mean violence. Screaming could be a mother being separated from her child at the slave market, or a public duel, or a single dead body which could lead to a murder investigation...or it could be a giant attack by Abyssals. You'll never know unless you go look!<br /> <br /> ...and leave me to see if I can figure out this puzzle-manse and figure out all of its secrets!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T10:55:27-07:00","id":432762,"title":"","content":"Very true. You live up to your screen name, Wise Old Guru. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> So I have been reading up on Arcane Fate. One success to remember the Sidereal seems to be a bit easy to achieve. However, apparently the dice roll isn't to remember the Sidereal, but remember the<i> event</i> with the Sidereal. The player trying to remember the event has to roll dice each time they try to recall the event, instead of just when the events ends.<br /> <br /> For example, if Swimming Owl and Flynn weren't wearing Resplendent Destinies during their conversation, then the Servant would have to roll Wits + Integrity - 3 each time he thinks about the conversation. If he gets one success he remembers the event at that specific time. If he fails, he forgets that Swimming Owl and Flynn were even there. If he gets three successes, then he will remember the EVENT without having the roll dice each time.<br /> <br /> So, since Flynn and Swimming Owl were in Resplendent Destinies during their conversation, the Servant will remember the conversation until the Destiny ends. Though if Swimming Owl ends her Destiny and Flynn doesn't, the Servant would remember Flynn talking to....someone....<br /> <br /> Seeing through Resplendent Destinies is different that remember events. A Sidereal gets a 3 dice bonus for convincing others that they are a Simple Musician, not a Scheming Fate Ninja. The person trying to see though the False Destiny loses 3 dice on their roll to see through the destiny. I assume you can use Investigation or something for this roll instead of Integrity. I am assuming that if you do see though the destiny, you are subject to the above Wit + Integrity - 3 roll to remember the time you saw through a Sidereal's Resplendent Destiny.<br /> <br /> If Flynn decides to take off his False Fate and break out with some Sweet Ninja Moves, then it would be extremely difficult to connect Flynn the Sidereal with Flynn the musician. And if a player does make the connection, then there is a good chance they will forget about it as time goes on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-08-2015, 01:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T15:28:10-07:00","id":437643,"title":"","content":"What time of day is it? Is it sunset? Full Night? Late afternoon?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T16:03:36-07:00","id":437675,"title":"","content":"It is just about sunset. By the time you get to the town it will be sunset already.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T16:28:07-07:00","id":437692,"title"