con__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are two alternative Form Acquisition Knacks in Dreams of the First - Lords of Creation, page 84-85.<br /> <br /> Compassionate Mirror Nature (Essence 3, Perception 4) - Which allows you to gain a human form with only a taste of blood.<br /> <br /> Courtesan's Possession (Essence 4, Wits 4) - Allows you to gain a human form via sexual intercourse.</div> </div> </div> </div>that is good information to know. it will be handy not HAVE to kill everyone i want to look like. much less attention drawing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T14:10:00-07:00","id":444871,"title":"","content":"Flynn is planning on trying to talk to the whatever it is, if possible. (I think the Servant is planning on the same thing) <br /> <br /> Unless the whatever is surrounded by corpses or what now. Then Flynn would probably stand back and let Nahuel do his thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T15:21:11-07:00","id":444975,"title":"","content":"Yeah, talking hasn't really crossed Nahuel's mind. When he sees you approaching it, he'll probably just assume you're trying to distract it. :P Talk fast!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T16:21:29-07:00","id":445056,"title":"","content":"Well... Here is the difficulty. You won't recognize Flynn when you see him. He doesn't think he can talk his way out of &quot;Yeah. I didn't freak out like the other because umm.... I'm special? But not in a &quot;I'm an Exalt special!&quot; Nope! Just normal mortal special!&quot; He would rather everyone think this random guy showing up is a Sidereal than Flynn the Musician.<br /> <br /> I also want to play with Arcane Fate to see how far I can push it.<br /> <br /> Also, you are ahead of everyone else, so it might come to combat just because of that. But Flynn will try to talk to it and try to figure out why it is here. What it wants. What its fiendish plans are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T16:51:50-07:00","id":445084,"title":"","content":"True, but I'm not jumping in blindly. That's why I rolled stealth instead of join battle, to try to get a better view of it before I attack.<br /> <br /> Isn't there a roll to recognize a Sidereal you've met, even in a Destiny?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T17:15:01-07:00","id":445092,"title":"","content":"Yes there is. The book does say what attributes and abilities you roll, but the roll is at a -3. I guessing either wits or perception with investigation or integrity. Loki will have to decide.<br /> <br /> Flynn will be in another destiny should he interact in the scene. So he will be rolling +3 dice. Probably rolling manipulation and performance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T22:32:44-07:00","id":445374,"title":"","content":"i just hope i don't have to figure out a way to save Nahuel. Having a coward as your back up is not a good thing, worse when you don't know hes a coward. i can see a conviction role in the near future.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T05:04:06-07:00","i