,"user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T17:57:53-07:00","id":446815,"title":"","content":"Nahuel! Now is your chance! Go hit on the hot goddess! Prove Flynn wrong! I'm sure she'd appreciate a friendly face after dealing with a death knight! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T21:16:34-07:00","id":447096,"title":"","content":"I am too sleepy to write a coherent iC post at the moment. I will make one tomorrow!<br /> <br /> Actually... strike that, I think I can manage it, the pace things are moving.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T21:33:52-07:00","id":447112,"title":"","content":"And... posted. If the guy isn't in reach, I can grow wings before attacking, but I'm hoping being on a roof means he's within jumping distance. I'm hoping this will make a good impression on allies, and a deep on the deathknight. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T21:38:42-07:00","id":447113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=447096#post447096\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am too sleepy to write a coherent iC post at the moment. I will make one tomorrow!<br /> <br /> Actually... strike that, I think I can manage it, the pace things are moving.</div> </div> </div> </div>Stunts, Virtue Channels, and Excellencies apply to ONE action in a flurry each. You can do new ones for new attacks.<br /> <br /> So that attack would blow 4 Valor channels, 4 WP, and 20? motes. (I assume you have a 5 in the attribute and are using a full excellency)<br /> <br /> Also, you would need to roll Join Battle first. (I don't think this would count as an ambush)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T22:17:12-07:00","id":447143,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=447113#post447113\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Stunts, Virtue Channels, and Excellencies apply to ONE action in a flurry each. You can do new ones for new attacks.<br /> <br /> So that attack would blow 4 Valor channels, 4 WP, and 20? motes. (I assume you have a 5 in the attribute and are using a full excellency)<br /> <br /> Also, you would need to roll Join Battle first. (I don't think this would count as an ambush)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You would need to roll battle and the attack will be noticed because you will have to fly to him. He will attempt to parry as normal. He is not within jumping distance without charms, so go ahead and transform and attack him. You will probably end up going first since his join battle roll pool is not good. You will also need to re-roll with correct dice.<br /> <br /> You also had some miscalculations for the roll. With <b>Dex 5 + MA 5</b> you can only use <b><u>+5 dice cap for 1st dex excellency </u></b> (lunars are capped at their attribute; not atrib+ability like solars). With the <b>valor 5</b> and a <b>2-die stunt</b> (you were right) that would be <u><b><i>22</i></b></u> dice <u>before calculating for the flurry. </u>The first would be at 18, next at 17, 16, and 15. (A flurry subtracts the number of things in a flurry for the first one, and one more for each after; this is assuming you channel valor 4 times). If you don't channel valor 4 times, it would be 18, 12, 11, and 10 dice. Since you can use hybrid rearrangement, there is no penalty for flying in the air after him and you don't need to make a str+ ath roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T06:00:27-07:00","id":447601,"title":"","content":"So.... Nahuel's idea of impressing a woman is bring her a dead bat and laying it at her feet?<br /> <br /> He really IS a cat!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-18-2015, 09:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T14:50:37-07:00","id":448306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=447601#post447601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So.... Nahuel's idea of impressing a woman is bring her a dead bat and laying it at her feet?<br /> <br /> He really IS a cat!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> A true cat; you fit the lunar prerogative very well <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T18:10:12-07:00","id":448550,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=447601#post447601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So.... Nahuel's idea of impressing a woman is bring her a dead bat and laying it at her feet?<br /> <br /> He really IS a cat!</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh, and I wasn't even thinking of it in that way. Makes sense though!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Now then, please do not speak to me as though I am an idiot or don't know the rules. I am aware of Lunar dice caps and how Excellencies work. I'll accept that it's out of jumping distance... but the entire point of stealthing first was so it would count as an ambush. I'll roll join battle nevertheless.<br /> <br /> I've always seen Virtue channels run as applying to the entire flurry; it seems more fair to me that they would, since you have such a limited number of them and they're hard to refresh.<br /> <br /> It makes even less sense that stunts only apply to the first roll instead of the entire thing.<br /> <br /> That, however, was my only miscalculation. I did spend 6m per attack on Dexcellency, as I have <b>Dexterity 6 </b>in my spirit shape, and Lunars their current true form to set their dice caps. I have a total of +3 accuracy between the base raptor cat stats and Claws of the Silver Moon.<br /> <br /> <br /> Dex 6 + martial arts 5 + 3 accuracy + 6 Excellency + 5 Valor + 2 stunt = 27 - 4 flurry = 23. My math was on, just barring the overly restrictive application of channel and stunt. I'll reroll the latter three with 7 less dice, and edit in a join battle roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T18:19:32-07:00","id":448581,"title":"","content":"IC post editted. Sorry if the last one here came off as too angry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T19:39:55-07:00","id":448664,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=448550#post448550\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heh, and I wasn't even thinking of it in that way. Makes sense though!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Now then, please do not speak to me as though I am an idiot or don't know the rules. I am aware of Lunar dice caps and how Excellencies work. I'll accept that it's out of jumping distance... but the entire point of stealthing first was so it would count as an ambush. I'll roll join battle nevertheless.<br /> <br /> I've always seen Virtue channels run as applying to the entire flurry; it seems more fair to me that they would, since you have such a limited number of them and they're hard to refresh.<br /> <br /> It makes even less sense that stunts only apply to the first roll instead of the entire thing.<br /> <br /> That, however, was my only miscalculation. I did spend 6m per attack on Dexcellency, as I have <b>Dexterity 6 </b>in my spirit shape, and Lunars their current true form to set their dice caps. I have a total of +3 accuracy between the base raptor cat stats and Claws of the Silver Moon.<br /> <br /> <br /> Dex 6 + martial arts 5 + 3 accuracy + 6 Excellency + 5 Valor + 2 stunt = 27 - 4 flurry = 23. My math was on, just barring the overly restrictive application of channel and stunt. I'll reroll the latter three with 7 less dice, and edit in a join battle roll.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think you are an idiot, and don't know what you know about the rules. If it came off that way I am sorry, but I was trying to clearly lay out what I understood was going on. For example, I was unsure about excellencies, because Relentless Lunar Fury raises the cap.<br /> <br /> Regarding stunts:<br /> <br /> Scroll of Errata p. 8<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> However, regardless of the number of times a character<br /> stunts per action, he is only granted stunt-based motes or Willpower<br /> once, based on the single highest-value stunt performed.<br /> In combat, this reward is granted when the character\u2019s DV refreshes.<br /> <br /> For example, a Solar stunts three attacks in a flurry\u2014a pair<br /> of one-die stunts followed by a two-die stunt. When his DV<br /> refreshes, he gains either four motes or one point of Willpower. </div> </div> </div>I asked on the irc about virtue channels, and it is apparent ST fiat. There is no official answer. I am sorry I suggested there was a particular way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T20:34:42-07:00","id":448754,"title":"","content":"Don't worry about it, I feel like I overreacted a bit as well.<br /> <br /> To avoid confusion in the future, Loki, can we get an ST confirmation of whether stunts and virtue channels give a dice bonus to one attack or a whole flurry?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T17:42:12-07:00","id":449939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=448550#post448550\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heh, and I wasn't even thinking of it in that way. Makes sense though!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Now then, please do not speak to me as though I am an idiot or don't know the rules. I am aware of Lunar dice caps and how Excellencies work. I'll accept that it's out of jumping distance... but the entire point of stealthing first was so it would count as an ambush. I'll roll join battle nevertheless.<br /> <br /> I've always seen Virtue channels run as applying to the entire flurry; it seems more fair to me that they would, since you have such a limited number of them and they're hard to refresh.<br /> <br /> It makes even less sense that stunts only apply to the first roll instead of the entire thing.<br /> <br /> That, however, was my only miscalculation. I did spend 6m per attack on Dexcellency, as I have <b>Dexterity 6 </b>in my spirit shape, and Lunars their current true form to set their dice caps. I have a total of +3 accuracy between the base raptor cat stats and Claws of the Silver Moon.<br /> <br /> <br /> Dex 6 + martial arts 5 + 3 accuracy + 6 Excellency + 5 Valor + 2 stunt = 27 - 4 flurry = 23. My math was on, just barring the overly restrictive application of channel and stunt. I'll reroll the latter three with 7 less dice, and edit in a join battle roll.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I completely forgot about claws of the silver moon being active and dex 6. You were correct on the calculations; My bad. I did not think you were stupid, but when I forgot those and thought about it, it looked like 5 additional dice had been added so it looked as if you had 10 dice from excellencies. The 2-die stunt does apply to all attacks in the set in my opinion. That is why I only subtracted 5 for the valor from the rest of the rolls (plus the flurry dice). If you channel the valor all four times, then those rolls are correct.<br /> <br /> In effect, stunt die will be for ALL attacks in a flurry, but virtue channels are not.<br /> <br /> As for the ambush, you had to fly in the middle of the air, so the stealth kind of ended its effect, since he was not next to the building. That is my thinking around it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> If you don't mind from now on, everyone please put where you are getting all the numbers from so I can confirm.<br /> A simple line like: dex 6+Ma 5+stunt 2+ valor 5+ CoSM 3+ exc 6= 27- 4 flurry would help me.<br /> <br /> I'm sorry I failed to keep track of that spell and 6 dex. I do this kind of stuff when I have the time (which is not much lately) and often try to do these calculations quickly, so I mess up. having a line like that above would help me.<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4150,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","user":"Loki","date":". 03-19-2015, 08:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T19:28:18-07:00","id":450029,"title":"","content":"Will do. Seems I need to use a damage-booster on this guy as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T20:50:15-07:00","id":450079,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=450029#post450029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Will do. Seems I need to use a damage-booster on this guy as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Try Terrifying Mane to get as many hair-limbs as you please, and Octopus-and-Spider Barrage to flurry one attack with each of them. Watch as their DV drops to nothing from onslaught and the enemy dies of ping.<br /> <br /> /joking","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T09:11:01-07:00","id":450511,"title":"","content":"in my head i imagined some of the passages rearranging so that unwary intruders stumbled into a magma pit. Magma pits are always usefull for garbage disposal if minecraft has taught me anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4157-luxweaver","name":"Luxweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4157_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T21:06:22-07:00","id":453766,"title":"","content":"@Loki - Does Flynn need to cross the field of battle to get to the figure in the woods?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T22:05:56-07:00","id":453833,"title":"","content":"You can turn back and run along the side of the woods if you wish. It is only a bit farther than running directly through the field.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T22:41:36-07:00","id":453852,"title":"","content":"Heh. Even right out of the gate, never underestimate a Full Moon for asskicking. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Since RPNation is down at the moment, I'm rolling with Invisible Castle, hope that's okay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1419,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","user":"WarDragon","date":". 03-23-2015, 01:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T23:11:24-07:00","id":453885,"title":"","content":"You cannot flurry a clinch. It is a 1-action only type. You could jump with him, or do something else in a flurry, but not use a crush attack in the clinch.<br /> <br /> The Servant will be going next, so I will post your results after (if it is not already taken care of).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T09:00:41-07:00","id":455884,"title":"","content":"Quick question: Does committed Essence for Artifacts come from Personal or Peripheral?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T09:29:06-07:00","id":455934,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=455884#post455884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quick question: Does committed Essence for Artifacts come from Personal or Peripheral?</div> </div> </div> </div>Peripheral, unless your an Alchemical installing charms. (Which aren't really artifacts, yada yada)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-24-2015, 01:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T17:20:22-07:00","id":456378,"title":"","content":"Loki, how long would it take the Lunar to reach where Flynn and the Dusk are?<br /> <br /> Also, if she attacks Flynn, does he get to Join Battle again?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T17:48:59-07:00","id":456394,"title":"","content":"It would take them about 20 seconds to reach if they rush. Normally, it would be about 40 seconds to a minute.<br /> <br /> If there is an attack, then yes, join battle will be rolled for everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T18:25:58-07:00","id":456461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=455884#post455884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quick question: Does committed Essence for Artifacts come from Personal or Peripheral?</div> </div> </div> </div>Whichever you want, but there's really no reason for it not to be peripheral.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T19:42:17-07:00","id":456499,"title":"","content":"Flynn in a few seconds...<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/236x/40/cb/3a/40cb3ad7f7a9b3e099cfa1b1bc1bd950.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> (Though I am having a lot of fun with this scene. Why is it that I enjoy torturing my characters? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T20:09:25-07:00","id":456516,"title":"","content":"Dawww... that is the cutest pic and an entirely accurate one for the situation. I'm even considering giving an exrta exp for it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> I'm glad you are liking the scene XD It actually went more quickly than I thought it would... lol. 'Dem moon children; I'm telling ya. I was hoping for it to be a BIT more of a challenge. :S<br /> I mean he WAS a sorcerer vs. a fighter, but still :/. Though sorcery in combat usually sucks at low levels and gets the caster killed (unless they prepare beforehand of course). Blood lash is fun and all though. And not having his shield up right away got him in trouble from the start. I'll keep that in mind for another time XD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-