it difficult to see what symbol it is.</div> </div> </div> </div>I honestly expected him to show up at any point during the fight. I think he/it is faster than most of you. Or perhaps use that fusion thing to snag the chump abyssal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T15:16:49-07:00","id":461588,"title":"","content":"Maybe there was another group of enemies the demon took care of?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T17:51:42-07:00","id":461683,"title":"","content":"So... I looked up the Fusion Ability your demon has.... Kind of scared that your character hates Sidereals now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Primal Fusion\u2014If in control of a clinch, Vorvin-Derlin can<br /> spend 20 motes to engulf a living victim in a mass of spiked<br /> filaments. The behemoth becomes a second skin, rooting itself<br /> deep into its victim\u2019s bones and muscles. Creatures without<br /> an active Essence are instantly engulfed. Targets that channel<br /> Essence can escape the behemoth\u2019s grip through a successful<br /> (Stamina + Resistance) roll. If Vorvin-Derlin succeeds in<br /> merging with a victim, it adds the host\u2019s rating in any traits<br /> marked with an asterisk in this write-up to its own rating<br /> for the duration of the fusion (Conviction and Temperance<br /> have a maximum of 5, however). A subsumed victim loses<br /> control over her body, and<b> the behemoth has access to all<br /> of her knowledge and memories</b>. Vorvin-Derlin can release<br /> hosts at will, usually to merge with a host of greater power. It<br /> leaves former hosts blind and horribly scarred (Appearance<br /> 1, plus effects of maiming and blindness).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-29-2015, 08:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T18:08:36-07:00","id":461716,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=461683#post461683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So... I looked up the Fusion Ability your demon has.... Kind of scared that your character hates Sidereals now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/