osts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T20:40:51-07:00","id":530605,"title":"","content":"Flynn wouldn't be training anyone in the style itself. Shadow Fingers give Flynn some special abilities that allow him to buff other Martial Artists.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 05-28-2015, 12:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T09:37:57-07:00","id":531091,"title":"","content":"For example:<br /> <br /> <b>Sifu's Useful Fingers</b><br /> <br /> Cost: 1m; Mins: Martial Arts 3, Essence 2<br /> Type: Simple (One dramatic action)<br /> Keywords: Combo-OK<br /> Duration: Indefinite<br /> Prerequisite Charms: None<br /> <br /> Sidereals advise the world; much of their power to act upon the world proceeds from this fact. Disdaining such crude weapons as fighting gauntlets or appropriated barstools, the Sidereal turns others into his instruments\u2014be they pawns or kings. The Sidereal may enlighten an individual with five minutes of one-on-one advice and simple-but-profound martial demonstrations.<b> The beneficiaries of such instruction temporarily enjoy one bonus dot of Martial Arts and add the Sidereal\u2019s Martial Arts rating to their Dodge MDV so long as the Vizier commits Essence to this Charm.</b> She may sustain a commitment to up to (Essence x 2) beneficiaries at once. Sidereals know such beneficiaries as shadow fingers.<b> If the character is a Sidereal Exalt, she automatically becomes aware when one of her shadow fingers is attacked, regardless of the distance separating them.</b><br /> <br /> <br /> Flynn's MA rating is 3 for right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T17:46:15-07:00","id":531434,"title":"","content":"An interesting prospect, yes... though the fluff is cause for some concern, and it's a bit odd given that Nahuel's the one going to be teaching Flynn. :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T18:05:42-07:00","id":531464,"title":"","content":"Ha! I was thinking about that. I figured since Flynn was trained in a different environment than Nahuel, he might know some techniques that Nahuel doesn't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T02:08:51-07:00","id":531805,"title":"","content":"Oh. I suppose you DONT need a tut