me. This is specifically called out in Autochthonia as part of how they remain relevant next to Alchemicals. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T20:49:40-07:00","id":532726,"title":"","content":"Loki: Per the conversion charts its 8 koku to the jade obol meaning 80=8.<br /> 8 lb silver = 24.75 jade obols, so 24 lb is 74.24 obols.<br /> <br /> Meaning the silver price is more than nine times the cash price.<br /> <br /> Which doesn't mean I would mind taking advantage of this IC.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T21:27:30-07:00","id":532747,"title":"","content":"Does Splendor have jade on him?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T22:17:03-07:00","id":532921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=532747#post532747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does Splendor have jade on him?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, but be does have what might be considered a gaudy amount of gold. That, and koku is paper.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T09:08:16-07:00","id":533255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=532921#post532921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, but be does have what might be considered a gaudy amount of gold. That, and koku is paper.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It is actually 10 obols, but I do see the mistake on converting to silver XD My bad. I will fix it in the post. I was thinking that it was less than a mina of jade, but more than resources 2. The silver price should then be 3 pounds of silver. I will go fix that in the post right now.<br /> <br /> Koku is the paper, but it is a part of the &quot;Jade currency&quot; used by the realm. That is why I called it &quot;jade&quot; even though it is not jade itself. A commoner shouldn't be holding jade or they would be in trouble.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4150,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","user":"Loki","date":". 05-30-2015, 12:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T09:33:46-07:00","id":533270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Loki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=533255#post533255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> It is actually 10 obols, but I do see the mistake on converting to silver XD My bad. I will fix it in the post. I was thinking that it was less than a mina of jade, but more than resources 2. The silver price should then be 3 pounds of silver. I will go fix that in the post right now.<br /> <br /> Koku is the paper, but it is a part of the &quot;Jade currency&quot; used by the realm. That is why I called it &quot;jade&quot; even though it is not jade itself. A commoner shouldn't be holding jade or they would be in trouble.</div> </div> </div> </div>Koku are funny. They are backed by rice rather than jade, and can't be used to buy the good stuff like slaves or jade. Its one more way the Realm keeps the peasants down.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T09:50:28-07:00","id":533314,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/361620-clash-of-the-southeast-ooc?p=533270#post533270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Koku are funny. They are backed by rice rather than jade, and can't be used to buy the good stuff like slaves or jade. Its one more way the Realm keeps the peasants down.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It really is interesting. It is almost like &quot;credit&quot; that is not really backed in the real world versus money which is backed by gold. The main difference of course being that the value of money changes based on the amount of gold available and number of bills being printed, whereas the value of jade never changes because the item itself is the worth. And depending on who you are, jade may be worth more or less to you. <br /> <br /> The Scarlet Empress definitely knew 