/forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-26T11:52:28-07:00","id":569465,"title":"","content":"When looking up naughty words for something else, I discovered that Little Bird is a euphemism for penis in Chinese. This makes Flynn's fake name of &quot;Little Blue Bird&quot; even more funny. Such a stereotypical name for a Male Chosen of Serenity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 06-26-2015, 02:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-27T08:17:45-07:00","id":570261,"title":"","content":"Lol. That is sorta funny. And I am finally back! Woo!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-09T12:09:50-07:00","id":584993,"title":"","content":"I don't think I have the patience for this Play by Post format, but I rather not give up on the game (or poor Flynn) just yet. Is anyone else still around?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-09T14:21:10-07:00","id":585194,"title":"","content":"I am. I was waiting for us to advance past &quot;Dressup, Reborn God-King Edition&quot; so we could start the &quot;The Sting, Reborn Godking Edition&quot; portion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-09T14:29:28-07:00","id":585200,"title":"","content":"Where you going to answer Flynn's question?<br /> <br /> If Loki is still around, we can fast forward though the tailor and get to the good stuff. Like coming up with a plan for the Goddess lady not to throw us to the deathknight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-10T06:16:41-07:00","id":585976,"title":"","content":"Feel free. I can skip forward a bit. I already have a plan... I can just have The Bug give you some info and tell you what the plan is and new things cropping up in town. I will do that tonight once I get off of work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-loki","name":"Loki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-10T17:04:55-07:00","id":586594,"title":"","content":"So a month has past? Can we give you what our characters were doing? I know Flynn would like to become known at court and among the local performers (musicians, actors, etc). His goal is to become friends with people of influence or money. We got to feed that army somehow.<br /> <br /> I know Splendor was talking about buying and re-opening the bar. Flynn has enough resources thanks to Yu-Shan Express to fund that (He will probably say that it is Swimming Owl's money.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-10T23:48:52-07:00","id":586857,"title":"","content":"Of course! Just let me know what you have been working on/training. I was just trying to give you the basic outline of events.<br /> <br /> The bar can be under your control if that is what you wish. I tried not to make anything TOO specific so that we could alter the small details if needed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4150-lo